From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:48:15 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] test: cover the stdio line limit for local and executor
 transports

Check that a JSON-RPC line exactly at MAX_MCP_STDIO_LINE_BYTES is accepted and that one byte more ends the stream (local) or yields LineTooLong and closes the transport (executor).
---
